Short:        Shows IFF pics. AGA support. V???
Author:       venekamp@wins.uva.nl (Gerben Venekamp)
Uploader:     venekamp wins uva nl (Gerben Venekamp)
Type:         dev/c
Requires:     KS3.0+, SAS C 6.50, Devpac 3.04
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This is my attempt to make an IFF ILBM Converter. I never
released it, because I never finished it. So, here is the
source code for  you to use or abuse.  It's no good to me
sitting on my hard disk. Let's share :)

The source is  pretty well documented,  so those who want
to learn, can do so. I believe the loader part works just
fine.  It is the save part that is *not* save to use.  BE
WARNED!!!! Do read the README for more information.

Should you like it,  or want to finish it, drop me a line
so I know it is being used or liked.
